# Save the Children (San d'Oria 1-3): its Ghelsba Outpost 32001 handler on another fight's win. A level 75 Warrior of
# San d'Oria with 1-3 current at Status 2 (GMs; Resonance current keeps RoV 1-1 out) and a Cloudy Orb: the orb traded
# to Hut_Door opens the menu (Wings of Fury, index 2; Save the Children wants no trade); 32000 updated with 33 (index
# 2, area 1): registered, entered (Wings of Fury's level cap 20); won by a GM (bfwin): 32001; finished: battlefieldWin
# 34, not 32: 1-3's handler does nothing (no key, Status 2 kept).
lists GhelsbaOutpost/Hut_Door/onTrade GhelsbaOutpost/onEventFinish/32001
char zone=GhelsbaOutpost pos=-163.5,-11.7,77.8 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=0
mission Rov Resonance current
mission Sandoria SmashTheOrcishScouts completed
mission Sandoria BatHunt completed
mission Sandoria SaveTheChildren current
item CloudyOrb
login
missionstatus Sandoria 2                # a GM
trade Hut_Door CloudyOrb x1             # the menu 32000 (Wings of Fury)
update 32000 option=33                  # index 2, area 1: registered, entered
finish                                  # in the arena
bfwin                                   # a GM: won; 32001
finish                                  # battlefieldWin 34: 1-3's handler: nothing
